  "notes": "Announced in the closing section of the Pixtral Large post. That section says the model is on the API as pixtral-large-latest, which looks like an error for mistral-large-latest; the API id is taken from the changelog and docs (mistral-large-2411). Cloud partners were announced as coming soon (Google Cloud and Microsoft Azure first), so cloud-partner access is not recorded at release. The docs now call it Mistral Large 2.1. The alias Mistral Large 2 is left to mistral.mistral-large-2, because the Pixtral Large model card uses that name for Mistral-Large-Instruct-2407."
